UID:LOwOlYGboxyDli-t7EPlO
SUMMARY:10th Anniversary Party
DTSTAMP:20260810T100449Z
DTSTART:20260822T120000Z
DESCRIPTION:We’re turning 10\, and we’re celebrating ALL WEEK LONG! \nJoin 
	us as we kick off our 10-Year Birthday Bash with a full week of events: \n
	Tuesday: Special High Five Members Night\nWednesday: Eureka Heights-themed
	 Trivia\nThursday: Celebrate 10 Years of Laces Out Run Club\nFriday: Eurek
	a Heights Garage Sale\nSaturday: Our 10-Year Birthday Bash!\nVIP Entry: 10
	 AM–12 PM\nOG beer pours\nLive music from CC Rider Band\nIce House Radio D
	J\nLive screen printing by GooseWorks\nFirkin tappings\nAnd a whole lot mo
	re! \nSunday: Eureka & Chill with a special Discs & Donuts post-Eureka Hei
	ghts party. \nCome raise a glass\, celebrate a decade of great beer\, and 
	make some new memories with us. We can’t wait to celebrate with you! \nLin
	k for VIP party\n\nhttps://www.eurekaheights.com/event/10th-anniversary-pa
	rty/\n\nFrom Eureka Heights Brewery
URL:https://www.eurekaheights.com/event/10th-anniversary-party/
LOCATION:Tap Room\, 941 W 18TH ST.\, Houston\, TX\, 77008\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:eureka-heights-brew-co
CATEGORIES:Eureka Heights Brewery
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
